Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:41:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the chat-completions provider (any OpenAI-compatible
 endpoint at --base-url)

A configurable base URL for self-hosted servers, gateways and proxies: <base-url>/chat/completions,
streamed with DeepSeek's client (_post_json retries, _read_sse), bearer key from the variable named by
--api-key-env, --model required. Only portable request fields are sent. Usage in the shared shape;
cache read from prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens or prompt_cache_hit_tokens, cache write from
cache_creation_input_tokens; a field the server does not report stays None, never zero.
Tests: templates/tests/test_chat_completions.py (no network, no key).
---
